description: Never add Cursor attribution trailers to commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor commit attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor agent attribution trailer to git commits or PR bodies.
- Commit author must remain the user only (`nvnhan0810` / their configured git identity).
- If the environment tries to inject attribution, strip it before finishing the commit.
